  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注)１ 貸借対照表計上額の上位銘柄を選定する段階で、特定投資株式とみなし保有株式を合算しておりません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２ 定量的な保有効果については記載が困難でありますが、&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;資産運用委員会等で&lt;/span&gt;定期的に検証を実施し保有の合理性を確認しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３ ニデック株式会社は2023年４月１日付で日本電産株式会社から社名変更しております。 &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
